            <div class="port-item"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:certificate-01" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon><div><b>Certificate</b><small>Issued when criteria met</small></div><span class="pst">Pending</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- MENTORS / FEEDBACK MODEL -->
<section id="mentors" class="mentors"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="l"><span class="eyebrow">Feedback model</span><h2>How mentor review actually works.</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:420px">Every released review has rubric scores, a pass/fail against 70, and a written change note. Attempts stay on record — no silent overwrites.</p></div>

  <div class="fb-process reveal" role="list">
    <div class="fb-step" role="listitem">
      <span class="bn">1</span>
      <div><b>You submit evidence</b><p class="muted">Gate artifact for the current phase — draft, pack, or demo materials.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fb-step" role="listitem">
      <span class="bn">2</span>
      <div><b>Mentor scores the rubric</b><p class="muted">Published criteria only. Same weights for employer and fellowship cohorts.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fb-step" role="listitem">
      <span class="bn">3</span>
      <div><b>Change note is released</b><p class="muted">One concrete change to make. Strengths can be named; the gate still needs 70+.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fb-step" role="listitem">
      <span class="bn">4</span>
      <div><b>You resubmit or unlock</b><p class="muted">Below 70 → reopen attempt. At 70+ → next gate unlocks. Prior attempts remain visible.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mentor-grid">
    <div class="mentor-visual reveal">
      <img src="{{{assets}}}/mentor-review.webp" alt="Mentor reviewing learner evidence against a published rubric">
      <div class="mentor-badge">
        <iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:note-01" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>
        <div><b>Review record</b><small>Scores + note + attempt history</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rubric" id="rubric">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span class="eyebrow">Interactive sample · Product rubric</span>
          <span class="chip">Pass at 70 / 100</span>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px">Drag each criterion the way a mentor would. Verdict updates live — same bar learners see after sign-in.</p>
        <div id="crits"></div>
        <div class="total"><span>Total <b id="tot">60</b><span class="muted">/100</span></span><span class="verdict no" id="verdict">Changes requested</span></div>
      </div>
      <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:18px">
        <li><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:tick-02" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>Rubric scores are released with the note</li>
        <li><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:tick-02" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>Below 70 keeps the next gate locked</li>
        <li><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:tick-02" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>Earlier attempts stay on the learner record</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- BECOME A MENTOR -->
<section id="become-mentor" class="become-mentor"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="l"><span class="eyebrow">Join the review team</span><h2>Want to be a mentor?</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:400px">We guide you through a short application, then our team contacts you for onboarding and track matching.</p></div>

  <article class="become-card reveal">
