      <img src="{{{assets}}}/mentor-review.webp" alt="Mentor reviewing learner evidence against a rubric">
      <span class="portal-media-lab"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:user-group" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon> Mentors</span>
    </div>
    <div class="become-content">
      <div class="portal-head" style="padding-top:22px">
        <span class="chip">Application</span>
        <h3>How mentoring works here</h3>
        <p class="muted">Mentors score evidence against published rubrics, write change notes learners can apply, and hold the same 70/100 bar for employer and fellowship cohorts.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="become-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="bn">1</span>
